Dear Sir/Madam,
This is to certify that Ms. P. Dhana Lakshmi, employed as a Junior Software=
 Engineer with our organization, is currently working under a hybrid work m=
odel.
As per her approved work arrangement:

  *   Work From Home (WFH): Monday and Friday
  *   Work From Office (WFO): Tuesday, Wednesday, and Thursday

Accordingly, Ms. Dhana Lakshmi is required to be physically present at the =
office from Tuesday to Thursday each week. She typically travels to the off=
ice on Tuesday afternoon and returns to her hometown on Thursday afternoon =
after completing her office responsibilities. On Monday and Friday, she per=
forms her duties remotely from her place of residence.
This confirmation is being provided at her request for official reference p=
urposes.

Regards,

Aarthi Kalidaas


